1
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:06,710
-[MARI] How was it?
-I have this strange feeling.

2
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:10,680
I've never really felt this way
about Luca before.

3
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,640
I don't know
how to explain it properly.

4
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:16,350
-[MARI] What do you mean?
-I don't know,

5
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:18,310
I just have this
very warm feeling.

6
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:22,110
-Hmm, well, okay.
-[LARA] Huh?

7
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:26,280
I don't really get it, but
that's not important. I really

8
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,070
hope you find the true love
you've been searching for.

9
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,200
[hums]

10
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:36,080
Uh... Are you okay?

11
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:39,330
I'm okay.
I just tripped, it's all.

12
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:42,130
Are you still not used
to those legs?

13
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:45,000
[LARA] Oh, you never trip?
We're home!

14
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:48,510
Ah, Lara!
You're home late.

15
00:00:48,630 --> 00:00:50,720
-We were worried.
-Yeah, call next time.

16
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,550
[♪ opening music begins]

17
00:02:16,340 --> 00:02:18,470
[♪ opening music ends]

18
00:02:21,060 --> 00:02:22,890
DOMINATE KINKI ! DOMINATE JAPAN!

19
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:24,690
ONE DAY UNTIL THE TOURNAMENT!

20
00:02:24,810 --> 00:02:28,230
Listen up! Good work today,
everyone. Let's call it early so

21
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:30,400
-you can rest up for tomorrow.
-Yes, sir!

22
00:02:32,570 --> 00:02:34,570
Mm, what is that?

23
00:02:35,410 --> 00:02:37,320
Well, it's called a banner.

24
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:41,580
Mr. Makoto just taught me
about it. What do you think?

25
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:45,540
-Isn't it wonderful?
-Yeah, it's great.

26
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,710
[crowd cheering]

27
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:50,340
Wait, shouldn't you
be at Ondakan?

28
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:52,050
No, I took the day off today.

29
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:53,760
-Hmm.
-Huh?

30
00:02:55,130 --> 00:02:57,550
-What are you watching?
-I'm studying the girl

31
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:02,100
-I'm going to fight tomorrow.
-[LARA] She looks really strong.

32
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,600
Maybe, but I'm still
going to win.

33
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,230
What will you do once you win?

34
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:09,190
Fight someone even stronger.

35
00:03:09,770 --> 00:03:12,530
-And after that?
-Someone even stronger.

36
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:13,990
Oh.

37
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:17,450
-[LARA] Aren't you scared?
-Of what?

38
00:03:19,990 --> 00:03:22,160
Hmm. Huh?

39
00:03:23,910 --> 00:03:24,750
Lara?

40
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,340
[gasps] Lara?

41
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:37,260
I'm just fine.
Don't worry about it.

42
00:03:38,550 --> 00:03:40,590
I just got a little sleepy.

43
00:03:43,060 --> 00:03:44,100
[sighs]

44
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,480
-[honk]
-Huh.

45
00:03:53,980 --> 00:03:55,400
SHIGA

46
00:04:03,990 --> 00:04:06,040
[FEMALE] Nice to meet you,
Mari Otsu.

47
00:04:08,410 --> 00:04:11,330
-I'm Lisa, Lara's older sister.
-[gasps]

48
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:17,590
[clock ticking]

49
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:27,020
[MARI] So you're really
Lara's older sister?

50
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:33,020
[LISA] I want you
to bring Lara back to me.

51
00:04:37,610 --> 00:04:41,120
Okay then, why don't you just
ask Lara yourself?

52
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:44,530
[LISA] You don't understand.
Lara is our princess.

53
00:04:45,540 --> 00:04:48,540
It is her duty to use her light
to save the mermaid race.

54
00:04:49,250 --> 00:04:50,540
[MARI] Her light?

55
00:04:50,670 --> 00:04:53,330
[LISA] Yes, the light
that only a princess

56
00:04:53,460 --> 00:04:55,420
can obtain
through finding true love.

57
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:59,670
But if she can't find it,
it won't be long

58
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,380
before she vanishes into foam.

59
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:07,430
-Huh?
-[LISA] Lara took a potion

60
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:12,230
to become human. That potion
has an expiration date.

61
00:05:13,310 --> 00:05:16,230
As soon as that date passes, she
will instantly turn into foam...

62
00:05:17,230 --> 00:05:18,240
...and die.

63
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:23,280
H- huh?

64
00:05:24,370 --> 00:05:26,240
How has Lara
been doing recently?

65
00:05:26,530 --> 00:05:27,490
[gasps]

66
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,580
Hmm. That's what I thought.

67
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:37,170
This potion...
will help slow down the process.

68
00:05:38,300 --> 00:05:40,550
It's the only thing
that can make her feel better.

69
00:05:42,090 --> 00:05:46,470
But, unfortunately,
this is only a temporary fix.

70
00:05:48,220 --> 00:05:50,430
If Lara wants to truly
save herself,

71
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:53,770
and her people,
she has to find true love.

72
00:05:55,650 --> 00:05:57,020
I'm worried about her.

73
00:05:59,190 --> 00:06:00,190
[MARI] Gon-chan!

74
00:06:00,990 --> 00:06:03,070
-Hm. What is it?
-[MARI] Lara.

75
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:08,120
It's not true, right?
Is she going to turn into foam?

76
00:06:09,450 --> 00:06:11,950
-Who told you that?
-[gasps]

77
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:18,960
LUCA

78
00:06:19,090 --> 00:06:20,670
A ladybug got in the studio.

79
00:06:23,010 --> 00:06:24,630
Do you know what a ladybug is?

80
00:06:27,430 --> 00:06:30,260
No, I don't. Can you
show me one next time?

81
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:42,990
[footsteps approaching]

82
00:06:43,110 --> 00:06:43,990
Hey, Mari.

83
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:48,160
Luca says he wants to come and
see your match tomorrow too.

84
00:06:50,290 --> 00:06:52,120
I met your sister earlier today.

85
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:56,290
-Lisa?
-I didn't believe her at first,

86
00:06:56,420 --> 00:06:58,040
but Gon-chan confirmed

87
00:06:58,170 --> 00:07:00,300
that you're going to turn
into foam and disappear soon.

88
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:01,960
[gasps]

89
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:06,010
[MARI] Why did you keep this
from me? Why didn't you tell me

90
00:07:06,130 --> 00:07:09,010
-about all this?
-[Lara gasps] I...

91
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,180
[sighs]
[thud]

92
00:07:13,180 --> 00:07:14,230
Lara!

93
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:20,060
You need to understand, Lara is
terrified of the human world.

94
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:24,530
There is no hope of her
ever finding true love

95
00:07:25,110 --> 00:07:26,360
while living in fear.

96
00:07:28,030 --> 00:07:33,250
So I beg you, for me,
you need to bring Lara

97
00:07:33,370 --> 00:07:35,120
back to us before it's too late.

98
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:43,550
-Lara.
-Mari.

99
00:07:49,050 --> 00:07:52,060
Hey, are you feeling any better?

100
00:07:54,390 --> 00:07:57,060
Sorry, I made you drink these
while you were asleep.

101
00:07:58,140 --> 00:08:00,020
Your sister said
it would help you.

102
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:06,110
I feel a lot better, actually.
Thank you.

103
00:08:08,900 --> 00:08:11,660
[LISA] But this is only
a temporary fix.

104
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:19,080
-So true love, huh?
-[LARA] Huh?

105
00:08:20,540 --> 00:08:22,130
Do you think you'll find it?

106
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:24,710
Huh? What?

107
00:08:27,210 --> 00:08:28,340
Of course I do.

108
00:08:29,470 --> 00:08:31,430
I heard that a mermaid
has never fallen in love

109
00:08:31,550 --> 00:08:32,680
with a human before.

110
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:37,680
-And yet...
-You're acting weird.

111
00:08:38,430 --> 00:08:41,480
Don't worry about me.
Just wait and see.

112
00:08:42,610 --> 00:08:44,650
Tomorrow everything will be
back to normal.

113
00:08:47,990 --> 00:08:51,110
I think you should
go back to your sister.

114
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:55,580
-[LARA] But why?
-You can't go on like this.

115
00:08:56,290 --> 00:08:58,580
What are you talking about?
I'm doing just fine.

116
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:02,630
-What did Lisa say to you?
-It doesn't matter.

117
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:06,210
Listen, I know I might be
causing a lot of trouble

118
00:09:06,340 --> 00:09:08,880
for you all, but please
let me stay here.

119
00:09:09,010 --> 00:09:11,800
Why?
Stop pretending you're okay.

120
00:09:11,930 --> 00:09:13,430
-I'm not pretending.
-You're lying!

121
00:09:13,550 --> 00:09:15,390
-I am not!
-Then why do you keep

122
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:17,600
looking at me like that?
Like you're scared?

123
00:09:19,020 --> 00:09:22,310
[LARA] What's the big deal?
I'm not going anywhere.

124
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,980
Once I fold the futon and
change my clothes, I'm coming

125
00:09:26,110 --> 00:09:28,360
to watch your match.
I'll work at Ondakan again,

126
00:09:28,490 --> 00:09:30,450
and I'll even help
with the laundry.

127
00:09:31,530 --> 00:09:34,530
And, and, and I'll get
even closer with Luca.

128
00:09:35,450 --> 00:09:40,540
And then... someday I'll find

129
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,040
true love.

130
00:09:47,170 --> 00:09:49,090
Yes, of course I'm scared!

131
00:09:56,260 --> 00:10:00,180
I just...
I don't want you to die.

132
00:10:15,530 --> 00:10:16,530
[car door opens]

133
00:10:23,870 --> 00:10:25,710
NOTOGAWA ARENA

134
00:10:27,290 --> 00:10:30,090
AUGUST 21ST TOURNAMENT DAY 1

135
00:10:30,300 --> 00:10:32,220
[crowd cheering]

136
00:10:34,590 --> 00:10:38,010
-Keep your hands up!
-Come on! Come on!

137
00:10:38,390 --> 00:10:40,560
[♪ gentle music]

138
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:48,480
I WON'T BE ABLE TO
SEE YOU FOR A WHILE.

139
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:54,320
I can't believe she disappeared
and only left a note.

140
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:57,320
-Well, that was sudden.
-It really was.

141
00:10:57,660 --> 00:11:00,370
She should have at least come
to cheer on Mari.

142
00:11:00,990 --> 00:11:02,330
Can't you contact Lara?

143
00:11:02,450 --> 00:11:04,290
No way.
She left her phone behind.

144
00:11:04,410 --> 00:11:06,250
-Hmm?
-That lady who called you

145
00:11:06,370 --> 00:11:08,630
is going to get in touch again,
right?

146
00:11:09,420 --> 00:11:10,420
I don't know.

147
00:11:13,550 --> 00:11:15,510
The potion seems to
have worked well.

148
00:11:17,050 --> 00:11:19,600
Don't worry, the effects
should last for a while.

149
00:11:20,930 --> 00:11:23,100
[LARA] Yeah, thank you.

150
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:28,270
Make yourself at home.
I want you to be comfortable.

151
00:11:30,190 --> 00:11:32,270
AUGUST 22ND TOURNAMENT DAY 2

152
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:36,070
[bell rings]
[crowd cheering]

153
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,700
-Come on!
-You can do it!

154
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:47,910
And the winner by decision
is red corner Mari Otsu

155
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:50,540
from Tezumiya,
Shiga Prefecture.

156
00:11:52,290 --> 00:11:56,170
[MAKOTO] Mari is amazing.
The finals are tomorrow.

157
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:03,310
Father and the others
are still asleep,

158
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:08,600
stuck in that dwelling that was
created by the accursed witch.

159
00:12:11,110 --> 00:12:16,990
So you were with her? Is there
a reason you can't tell me?

160
00:12:20,870 --> 00:12:23,700
Lara, don't worry.

161
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,790
I won't let her bother you
anymore.

162
00:12:35,050 --> 00:12:38,170
-Lisa, you fool!
-Are you going to pester me

163
00:12:38,300 --> 00:12:40,180
to bring her back
like you always do?

164
00:12:41,340 --> 00:12:44,800
-Is that what you want me to do?
-No.

165
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:56,110
AUGUST 23RD TOURNAMENT
DAY 3: FINAL

166
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:03,530
[LISA] Since long ago
in ancient times,

167
00:13:04,410 --> 00:13:07,080
the mermaid princesses have all
brought light into our world

168
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:10,750
through their deep love for the
ocean. There are no exceptions.

169
00:13:12,210 --> 00:13:15,090
As long as that light shines,
father and the others will be

170
00:13:15,210 --> 00:13:19,420
saved, and you too will be
spared from turning into foam.

171
00:13:24,550 --> 00:13:26,510
You may stay
as long as you like.

172
00:13:31,020 --> 00:13:33,520
I'm going to cheer my heart
out again today.

173
00:13:33,650 --> 00:13:34,610
Yeah.

174
00:13:36,020 --> 00:13:38,110
[panting]

175
00:13:38,650 --> 00:13:40,570
[LUCA]
Huh? She's not here either?

176
00:13:41,610 --> 00:13:44,490
-Then where is she?
-[MARI] I don't know.

177
00:13:44,990 --> 00:13:46,830
What?
Have you tried calling her?

178
00:13:46,950 --> 00:13:48,240
-I haven't.
-[LUCA] What?

179
00:13:49,250 --> 00:13:51,660
This isn't like her.
Are you not worried?

180
00:13:52,830 --> 00:13:55,290
[MARI] No, I'm not, because
Lara isn't coming back.

181
00:13:55,670 --> 00:13:57,500
-[LUCA] Why?
-Just shut up already.

182
00:13:58,380 --> 00:14:01,170
Did you guys have a fight or
something? It doesn't make

183
00:14:01,300 --> 00:14:03,720
any sense.
How could you not know?

184
00:14:04,300 --> 00:14:05,930
-Sorry.
-What?

185
00:14:07,220 --> 00:14:09,640
Don't know. I don't know
anything about mermaids, okay?

186
00:14:10,100 --> 00:14:13,390
Hey, what's wrong with you?
[grunts]

187
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:19,320
[♪ solemn music]

188
00:14:25,530 --> 00:14:29,080
Humans are hideous,
despicable creatures.

189
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,910
[LARA] I've fallen in love.

190
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:33,960
For a mermaid and a human
to fall in love.

191
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:36,630
[LARA] For the first time,
I feel a kind of warmth.

192
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:42,470
You must go and find true love,
Lara.

193
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:51,060
[LARA] Who am I, really?

194
00:14:58,310 --> 00:15:00,440
NOTOGAWA ARENA

195
00:15:01,110 --> 00:15:02,900
The high school girls'
bantamweight final

196
00:15:03,030 --> 00:15:03,990
is about to begin.

197
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,290
-What's that?
-Huh.

198
00:15:15,790 --> 00:15:18,080
I can't hear a damn thing
with all this wind.

199
00:15:18,710 --> 00:15:21,340
I'm actually on a boat heading
for home right about now.

200
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:22,710
Yeah.

201
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:31,970
Otsu, only those
who are prepared to fight

202
00:15:32,100 --> 00:15:33,350
get to go up into the ring.

203
00:15:34,980 --> 00:15:37,350
-Yes.
-Although I must say,

204
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:40,060
you don't look like you're up
for it at all right now.

205
00:15:40,690 --> 00:15:43,110
You're wrong.
I'm gonna beat them up.

206
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:45,940
What are you saying to her?

207
00:15:46,610 --> 00:15:48,360
I've got her fired up, don't I?

208
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:55,040
[phone vibrating]

209
00:15:55,540 --> 00:15:57,370
-Hello?
- [LARA] Luca, can you hear me?

210
00:15:57,500 --> 00:15:58,670
Hello, are you there?

211
00:15:59,670 --> 00:16:03,250
-Luca, it's me, Lara.
-Lara? I can't hear you at all.

212
00:16:03,380 --> 00:16:04,500
Hello, can you hear me?

213
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:05,630
LUCA AKIZUKI

214
00:16:06,970 --> 00:16:09,930
[LUCA] Lara, where are you?
What are you doing?

215
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,600
I'm on a boat right now
with my sister.

216
00:16:13,310 --> 00:16:15,560
-You're what?
-I said I'm on a boat.

217
00:16:17,350 --> 00:16:20,400
Lara, Lara, are you okay?

218
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:22,940
-I was worried about you.
- [LARA] I'm sorry.

219
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:27,490
I might not be able to see you
guys ever again. I'm sorry.

220
00:16:28,450 --> 00:16:30,910
You're going to have to
speak up. I'm sorry.

221
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:35,160
-I said this has to be goodbye.
-Lara?

222
00:16:35,620 --> 00:16:37,620
[LARA] I don't understand
anything anymore.

223
00:16:38,620 --> 00:16:42,000
[LARA] I... what's the point?
I just...

224
00:16:42,380 --> 00:16:44,540
Next up, the high school girls'
bantamweight

225
00:16:44,670 --> 00:16:48,010
final match.
In the red corner, we have...

226
00:16:48,130 --> 00:16:50,220
[LARA]
Is Mari's match starting soon?

227
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:53,100
[LUCA] Oh, right.
I thought you were coming,

228
00:16:53,220 --> 00:16:54,600
so I came over. Hold on.

229
00:16:55,430 --> 00:16:58,480
Look at your screen. It looks
like it's just about to start.

230
00:17:07,860 --> 00:17:09,110
Lara, aren't you coming?

231
00:17:12,030 --> 00:17:13,950
What do you want to do?
Coming?

232
00:17:14,450 --> 00:17:15,620
I just want to...

233
00:17:18,500 --> 00:17:19,540
[bell rings]

234
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:21,040
I just want...

235
00:17:30,220 --> 00:17:31,260
[gasps]

236
00:17:45,110 --> 00:17:46,150
Lara!

237
00:17:47,530 --> 00:17:49,650
[crowd cheering]

238
00:17:50,940 --> 00:17:53,990
[LARA] I've decided I'm going
back to the human world.

239
00:17:54,450 --> 00:17:56,240
[LISA] You don't
understand still?

240
00:17:56,370 --> 00:17:59,040
It's impossible for you
to fall in love with a human.

241
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:03,250
[LARA] Maybe it is impossible.
I know that.

242
00:18:04,630 --> 00:18:09,460
That's what scared me too.
But even though I was scared,

243
00:18:10,670 --> 00:18:13,130
there was someone on the surface
who took my hand.

244
00:18:16,430 --> 00:18:18,930
I met people
who made me feel at home,

245
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,350
even though I'm not from here.

246
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:28,610
They made me feel as if this is
where I'm supposed to be.

247
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:34,910
It's here on the above world
with these people

248
00:18:35,030 --> 00:18:36,660
that I feel the light the most.

249
00:18:36,990 --> 00:18:39,490
[grunting]

250
00:18:40,450 --> 00:18:45,460
[LARA] So even though I may
be scared, I won't... give up!

251
00:18:46,540 --> 00:18:48,710
[crowd cheering]

252
00:18:50,300 --> 00:18:53,050
[grunting]

253
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:58,550
[MARI] No way.
This isn't happening.

254
00:18:58,680 --> 00:18:59,850
OMI'S LIGHTNING

255
00:18:59,970 --> 00:19:01,310
I don't wanna lose!

256
00:19:02,890 --> 00:19:05,020
[crowd cheering]

257
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:09,650
[breathing]

258
00:19:16,450 --> 00:19:17,570
No.

259
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:24,540
Mari!

260
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:27,290
[panting]

261
00:19:31,130 --> 00:19:33,510
[panting]

262
00:19:41,310 --> 00:19:44,100
[whimpering]
No way.

263
00:19:45,390 --> 00:19:47,100
There's no way I'm giving up!

264
00:19:48,350 --> 00:19:50,980
What the...
Well, come on!

265
00:19:51,110 --> 00:19:53,690
[grunting]

266
00:19:54,110 --> 00:19:55,360
Mari!

267
00:20:15,510 --> 00:20:17,470
[WOMAN] Mari is so strong.

268
00:20:18,970 --> 00:20:21,550
Although I guess that's
how I raised her.

269
00:20:23,930 --> 00:20:25,270
I have no doubt about it.

270
00:20:26,180 --> 00:20:28,730
She's going to be strong enough
to make it on her own.

271
00:20:31,060 --> 00:20:35,360
But still, even so,
there will come a time

272
00:20:35,820 --> 00:20:39,200
when she finds someone
who will walk beside her.

273
00:20:41,990 --> 00:20:43,200
-Oh.
-Yeah.

274
00:20:50,540 --> 00:20:53,500
[snoring]

275
00:20:53,630 --> 00:20:58,130
The both of you. You're going
to hear it when we get home.

276
00:21:00,090 --> 00:21:01,510
And they're asleep.

277
00:21:02,970 --> 00:21:05,470
They almost look like twins
when they're snoozing.

278
00:21:10,230 --> 00:21:12,310
[MARI]
So what are you going to do now?

279
00:21:13,270 --> 00:21:15,110
I'm going to keep
looking for love here.

280
00:21:16,150 --> 00:21:18,360
-[MARI] So nothing new then?
-[LARA] That's right.

281
00:21:19,360 --> 00:21:22,240
[LARA] But from now on, I'm not
going to be afraid anymore,

282
00:21:22,910 --> 00:21:24,200
even if it's scary.

283
00:21:25,580 --> 00:21:28,620
-[MARI] Hmm.
-[LARA] What do you mean "hmm"?

284
00:21:28,750 --> 00:21:30,080
You're the one who asked.

285
00:21:32,630 --> 00:21:35,290
-What are you going to do, Mari?
-What do you mean?

286
00:21:35,840 --> 00:21:37,260
-From now on.
-Hmm.

287
00:21:37,760 --> 00:21:40,470
Well, fight someone even
stronger, I guess.

288
00:21:41,090 --> 00:21:43,140
-And then?
-Someone even stronger.

289
00:21:43,590 --> 00:21:46,680
-Does it ever end?
-Never. It's a way of life.

290
00:21:47,310 --> 00:21:50,140
-Pretty cool, right?
-I guess so.

291
00:21:51,560 --> 00:21:53,230
Well, maybe I'll go pro.

292
00:21:53,900 --> 00:21:55,610
-[LARA] Pro?
-If I become

293
00:21:55,730 --> 00:21:57,900
the best in the world,
maybe even you'll understand.

294
00:21:58,530 --> 00:22:01,320
-Hmm.
-What's that supposed to mean?

295
00:22:02,860 --> 00:22:06,490
Okay, if you become the best in
the world, I'll bake you a cake.

296
00:22:07,120 --> 00:22:09,580
-Uh.
-I can even make custard,

297
00:22:09,700 --> 00:22:12,210
-your favorite.
-[sighs]

298
00:22:14,500 --> 00:22:17,500
-[MARI] Oh yeah, you mean it?
-[LARA] Of course I do.

299
00:22:18,920 --> 00:22:20,590
[MARI] You've got yourself
a deal.

300
00:22:21,380 --> 00:22:23,010
I need you to promise me though.

301
00:22:23,970 --> 00:22:26,470
[LARA] Yeah, I promise.

302
00:22:27,970 --> 00:22:29,270
TO BE CONTINUED

303
00:22:30,180 --> 00:22:32,350
[♪ closing music begins]

